                                                "sense_id": "35d7bfa4-918b-3e25-b51b-c2b32ee5a395",
                                                "text": "...and I sometimes think whether, like the ancient king, it would not be prudent to make an offering to destiny, and throw my set of emeralds into the lake.\" Emily could not but deprecate the emeralds being destined to any such preventive service;..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a87bdc19-cb7f-34ea-8898-9d730015b7c6",
                                        "entry_id": "e6f58e40-80fa-33cf-a2d3-c9c188bbe75c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Carried out to deter military aggression."
